#: 7d2d7754474943e18c4060060a839d0c
msgid "Any configuration change to a UART requires a re-boot to take effect. Reminder: UART numbers do not necessarily map to SERIALx numbers. Check the :ref:`board's description<common-autopilots>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-FPort-receivers.rst:36
#: 9dd4c4eb1d4e4571bf87b327674c8493
msgid "In general, F4 based autopilots using an external bi-directional inverter can use any UART with the following configuration:"
msgstr ""

